{
  "info": {
    "name": "ORScribe",
    "description": "Postman collection for ORScribe — Operating Room conversation intelligence REST API.\n\nIngests OR audio, identifies surgical team roles, extracts an intraoperative timeline, and verifies WHO Surgical Safety Checklist completion.\n\nCollection variables:\n- `baseUrl` — default http://localhost:8030\n- `apiKey` — X-API-Key header value\n- `staffId` — X-Staff-Id header value\n- `caseId` — auto-set after creating a case\n\nWorkflow:\n1. Health Check\n2. Analyze Audio (one-shot, no polling)\n3. Create Case (post-hoc with audio, or streaming without audio)\n4. Upload Audio Chunk (streaming cases)\n5. Poll Get Case until status is `completed`\n6. Get Transcript / Get Checklist\n7. Update Roles (if needs_review)\n8. Approve Case",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8030"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "change-me-to-a-secure-random-key"
    },
    {
      "key": "staffId",
      "value": "nurse-1"
    },
    {
      "key": "caseId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code equals 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('Response has field status', function () {",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('status');",
              "});",
              "pm.test('Response has field database', function () {",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('database');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "health"]
        },
        "description": "Check service health (database, OpenAI configuration). No auth required."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Healthy",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "health"]
            }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
          "cookie": [],
          "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"database\": \"ok\",\n  \"redis\": \"ok\",\n  \"details\": {\n    \"service\": \"ORScribe\",\n    \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n    \"openai_configured\": true,\n    \"role_id_model\": \"gpt-4o\",\n    \"record_model\": \"gpt-4o\"\n  }\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Analyze Audio (One-Shot)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code equals 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('Response has transcript, roles, and timeline', function () {",
              "    var json = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('raw_transcript');",
              "    pm.expect(json.raw_transcript.segments.length).to.be.above(0);",
              "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('role_map');",
              "    if (!json.needs_review) {",
              "        pm.expect(json.timeline).to.have.property('events');",
              "        pm.expect(json.checklist).to.have.property('sign_in');",
              "    }",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {"key": "X-API-Key", "value": "{{apiKey}}"},
          {"key": "X-Staff-Id", "value": "{{staffId}}"}
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "audio",
              "type": "file",
              "src": "C:/Users/User/Desktop/AI-Services/ORScribe/samples/or_case_sample.wav",
              "description": "Required. Must be the .wav FILE, not the samples folder. Path: ORScribe/samples/or_case_sample.wav"
            },
            {
              "key": "procedure_type",
              "value": "laparoscopic cholecystectomy",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/analyze",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "analyze"]
        },
        "description": "Upload audio and receive the full pipeline result in one response: diarized transcript, speaker roles, intraoperative timeline, and WHO checklist. No case ID, polling, or auth headers required. Accepts multipart `audio` or JSON `audio_base64`. If role confidence is low, `needs_review` is true and timeline/checklist may be null."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Analyze Audio (Raw JSON)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"audio_base64\": \"UklGRnQAAABXQVZFZm10IBAAAAABAAEAQB8AAIA+AAACABAAZGF0YVAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA==\",\n  \"filename\": \"or_case.wav\",\n  \"procedure_type\": \"laparoscopic cholecystectomy\",\n  \"context_type\": \"operating_room\",\n  \"attendees\": [\n    \"surgeon\",\n    \"anesthetist\",\n    \"nurse\",\n    \"scrub_tech\",\n    \"resident\"\n  ],\n  \"purpose\": \"full_transcript_review\",\n  \"detail_level\": \"standard\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/analyze",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "analyze"]
        },
        "description": "Same endpoint as Analyze Audio, but Body is raw JSON with base64-encoded audio (no file upload, no auth headers).\n\nReplace `audio_base64` with your own file encoded as base64. Data URLs are also accepted: `data:audio/wav;base64,...`"
      },
      "response": []
    },
